OL,5,G0830 Bowman Sunday 8.30
OL,6,     FJohn Bowman takes a look back
OL,7,     Fthrough the RTE Radio archives and
OL,8,     Fpresents some of his favourite
OL,9,     Frecordings
OL,10,G0900 Sunday Miscellany
OL,11,     FA mix of 'music and musings' from
OL,12,     Fradio essays to reportage,
OL,13,     Fappreciations, memory pieces,
OL,14,     Fpoetry, travel writing to personal
OL,15,     Faccounts of events and happenings
OL,16,G1000 Supercharged with Anna Geary
OL,17,     FAnna opens up the conversation
OL,18,     Faround our bodies and minds with a
OL,19,     Fmix of expert advice, impactful
OL,20,     Fpersonal stories, listener voice
OL,21,     Fnotes, and practical life hacks.
